{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the road in this massive sequel to the million-selling Cook, Serve, Delicious series, as you travel across the United States to the Iron Cook Foodtruck Championships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of your robot companions Whisk and Cleaver, you'll serve over 200 foods to the hungry masses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/23053b5ac49a77703d987a0283a00444.poster.avif?t=1756841213\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/23053b5ac49a77703d987a0283a00444.webm?t=1756841213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/23053b5ac49a77703d987a0283a00444.mp4?t=1756841213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single Player &amp; Local Splitscreen Co-Op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roadtrips are better with friends! Play through the campaign via single player or with a friend in local splitscreen co-op. You can even change between single player and co-op on the fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/d82d422cbe6ad9f91f0770d267c91047.avif?t=1756841213\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>100 Hours of Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your roadtrip to the Iron Cook Foodtruck Championships will take you on a journey spanning 387 levels! That's over 100 hours of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/c32e3d1268871bb8c266d1d0770a1366.poster.avif?t=1756841213\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/c32e3d1268871bb8c266d1d0770a1366.webm?t=1756841213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/c32e3d1268871bb8c266d1d0770a1366.mp4?t=1756841213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Food Truck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your food truck with dozens of gameplay-affecting modules. And while you're at it, why not decorate? With over 100 different trinkets, you can really go to town to make your food truck your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/82349c51997c846e51c3dc5681ec1d95.poster.avif?t=1756841213\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/82349c51997c846e51c3dc5681ec1d95.webm?t=1756841213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skills to the test, or... take it easy. Cook, Serve, Delicious! 3?! comes equipped with multiple difficulty settings to match your skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes numerous accessibility options, including motion settings, flashing/strobe options, audio, and colorblind features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/678e65b403f32a3c892e78a283d5cb65.poster.avif?t=1756841213\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/678e65b403f32a3c892e78a283d5cb65.webm?t=1756841213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/678e65b403f32a3c892e78a283d5cb65.mp4?t=1756841213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Award Winning Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook, Serve, Delicious! 3?! includes nearly two hours of amazing original music by composer Jonathan Geer for you to groove along to while cooking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winner of the Indiecade Award for Best Audio.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What We're Serving</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the campaign via single player or with a friend in local co-op (with the ability to change on the fly).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your food truck with dozens of gameplay-affecting modules!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your food catalog with over two hundred foods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your food truck with dozens of trinkets that span the US!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of accessibility features that allow you to play the most comfortably you'd like, including motion settings, flashing/strobe settings, audio and colorblind features, and tons more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a hundred hours of gameplay spanning 387 levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An amazing original soundtrack by award-winning composer Jonathan Geer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck verified!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rev up those fryers because it's time to hit the road and get cooking!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Road Trip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1000030/214166780947bbd64a6a0f6e54ce46036370d2ed.jpg"},{"name":"Nearly Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1000030/7a1f4f759640fdb33b3517a3049b480bd05a4ead.jpg"},{"name":"We Are in Kansas, Actually","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1000030/b3d5da7e945946ff32f3a1de3f22f80f5b501ed4.jpg"},{"name":"Copper Top","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1000030/cd1d4153639d38b8c2afe4709288082ada208d71.jpg"},{"name":"Silver Spoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1000030/415e280d9977946f77ca72c2daaffcc32fddcaad.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Spud","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1000030/3b3af5afd0a7268cb292754cd9312e141d25780e.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Canyons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1000030/185aba90704756d6d9c2968028939904ca0d5ff0.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Hill Zone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1000030/05fb30d3552e09a3ca73d1380fffed4de8afecaf.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Tornado","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1000030/977d3570b20fc0086407553c9eb19fa6ec81d050.jpg"},{"name":"I Don't Need Tutorials","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1000030/229abd0dfb8ab8e82a9f548181ffb383bf161a54.jpg"}],"total":57},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1000030?t=1756841213","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1000030?t=1756841213","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/96671a66567b407c383fe5e84ecb81f0960b1dbd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756841213","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/96671a66567b407c383fe5e84ecb81f0960b1dbd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756841213","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on Phone","id":41},{"description":"Remote Play on Tablet","id":42},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the road in this massive sequel to the million-selling Cook, Serve, Delicious series, as you travel across the United States to the Iron Cook Foodtruck Championships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of your robot companions Whisk and Cleaver, you'll serve over 200 foods to the hungry masses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/23053b5ac49a77703d987a0283a00444.poster.avif?t=1756841213\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/23053b5ac49a77703d987a0283a00444.webm?t=1756841213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/23053b5ac49a77703d987a0283a00444.mp4?t=1756841213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single Player &amp; Local Splitscreen Co-Op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roadtrips are better with friends! Play through the campaign via single player or with a friend in local splitscreen co-op. You can even change between single player and co-op on the fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/d82d422cbe6ad9f91f0770d267c91047.avif?t=1756841213\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>100 Hours of Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your roadtrip to the Iron Cook Foodtruck Championships will take you on a journey spanning 387 levels! That's over 100 hours of gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/c32e3d1268871bb8c266d1d0770a1366.poster.avif?t=1756841213\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/c32e3d1268871bb8c266d1d0770a1366.webm?t=1756841213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/c32e3d1268871bb8c266d1d0770a1366.mp4?t=1756841213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Food Truck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your food truck with dozens of gameplay-affecting modules. And while you're at it, why not decorate? With over 100 different trinkets, you can really go to town to make your food truck your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/82349c51997c846e51c3dc5681ec1d95.poster.avif?t=1756841213\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/82349c51997c846e51c3dc5681ec1d95.webm?t=1756841213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skills to the test, or... take it easy. Cook, Serve, Delicious! 3?! comes equipped with multiple difficulty settings to match your skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes numerous accessibility options, including motion settings, flashing/strobe options, audio, and colorblind features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/678e65b403f32a3c892e78a283d5cb65.poster.avif?t=1756841213\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/678e65b403f32a3c892e78a283d5cb65.webm?t=1756841213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/extras/678e65b403f32a3c892e78a283d5cb65.mp4?t=1756841213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Award Winning Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook, Serve, Delicious! 3?! includes nearly two hours of amazing original music by composer Jonathan Geer for you to groove along to while cooking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winner of the Indiecade Award for Best Audio.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What We're Serving</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the campaign via single player or with a friend in local co-op (with the ability to change on the fly).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your food truck with dozens of gameplay-affecting modules!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your food catalog with over two hundred foods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your food truck with dozens of trinkets that span the US!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of accessibility features that allow you to play the most comfortably you'd like, including motion settings, flashing/strobe settings, audio and colorblind features, and tons more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a hundred hours of gameplay spanning 387 levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An amazing original soundtrack by award-winning composer Jonathan Geer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck verified!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rev up those fryers because it's time to hit the road and get cooking!</p>","developers":["Vertigo Gaming Inc."],"dlc":[1231250],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1000030/header.jpg?t=1756841213","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.8 and above<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Note: for full Steam MacOS functionality, right click on CSD 3 in Steam for Mac, and go to Properties. Go to the Betas tab and select &quot;mac_steam&quot;</li></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":79,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/cook-serve-delicious!-3!?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1000030/21061763/e67d6345fc0bbda3d51878a00af92f693fe65619/1753925051/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754967092","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1000030/21061763/e67d6345fc0bbda3d51878a00af92f693fe65619/17